      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am building a FPV drone world in Udon.\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_39dc7d43-4f87-488a-85bf-c38da0c65ad1\nIt is difficult to assign gamepad inputs to drone controls on XBoxes and other game pads because the sticks are assigned to move and change the viewpoint.\nIt would be useful if the ability to assign gamepad inputs to VRChat operations could be disabled and made available to Udon as an option, even if it is just a command line argument.\nAlso, when receiving custom device input as World OSC in the future, it would be inconvenient to have it assigned to VRChat operations because the custom device is an XInput.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "6473ee94a4c2a2090cc06a9f",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5f6a3f9e9cd6f33a86cd9111",
        "alias": "Keppel green Moth",
        "aliasID": "65c2a219ed6eefce4c62dd78",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny-assets.io/images/c784710a3e8ceaba7a220b1fcf595685.png",
        "created": "2020-09-22T18:17:02.780Z",
        "name": "- Kyuubi -",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": "<redacted>"
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "58c62efae9868f3662e9d9a1",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2023-05-29T00:15:16.137Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "integrationSourceType": null,
      "internal": false,
      "itemSourceType": null,
      "mentionedUserIDs": null,
      "mentionedUsers": [],
      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "62ad12660ac4f12290c3cd67",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 2
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In my case the Idea was to be in VR while being able to play another game with controller on desktop and streaming that to a video player in the world I am in.\n\nThe streaming part works perfectly fine, blocking controller input to VRC does not, since there is seemingly no way to make VRC NOT detect input even when unfocused. All gamepad inputs on VRC side have been unmapped, disabling or enabling Steam Input doesn't change anything, neither starting VRC without Steam. I focus the other game and when moving around there, it moves me in VRC as well with the controller, which is ridiculous at best. I checked the vrc docs and there is nothing related of course aside the explanation for gamepad support.\n\nA simple launch option, checkmark ingame or whatever to disable all gamepad input, would be the easiest straight forward solution.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
