      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is honestly getting ridiculous as I've spent far to many hours trying to figure out ways to disable this or find a work around, instead of playing games. People hang out in VRChat to talk with friends while playing other games. This isn't so unusual. And it can't be that hard of a fix, unless you guys have some how painted yourselves into that much of a corner with your input system code.\n\nWork arounds have been found, but then as things change with Steam, those work arounds break themselves.\n\nI might just be venting some frustration here, but this one has been one of those, \"An issue for far too long\" issues, where a lot of major features I care far less, and took a lot more time to develop, have gotten through, over a simple fix...",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
